    plane="leaf: site Sentinel-2 leaf-out 16 Apr, leaf-fall 14 Nov (RESULT §B); bloom Apr-May S69",
    ash="leaf: site Sentinel-2; bloom 'early spring or even in autumn' S7 (no months: no flowers drawn)",
